      "Strata Property Services handles the complete water damage repair process — from restoration (drying) through drywall repair, texture matching, and final painting. Our crews specialize in Strata units where quality expectations are high and disruption must be minimized. We coordinate with insurance adjusters and provide the documentation needed for claims. Call 604-761-1518 to schedule a repair assessment.",
