      "Managing a Strata building in Vancouver requires tracking dozens of maintenance items across multiple building systems. Missing even one critical item — like clearing roof drains before the rainy season or servicing the fire suppression system — can result in costly damage, insurance claims, or bylaw violations. This comprehensive checklist covers the major systems and tasks that every Vancouver Strata council should be tracking.",
      "BUILDING ENVELOPE: Inspect roof membrane and flashings (biannual), clear roof drains and scuppers (quarterly), inspect and maintain siding/cladding (annual), check window and door seals (annual), inspect balcony membranes and railings (annual), clean and inspect gutters and downspouts (biannual), check parkade membrane and drainage (annual), and review building envelope maintenance report if applicable.",
